/users/akohlmey/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akohlmey/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"618a74ea884f0957a7f694af9c237c395255f489","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lammps/lammps/commits/618a74ea884f0957a7f694af9c237c395255f489","html_url":"https://github.com/lammps/lammps/commit/618a74ea884f0957a7f694af9c237c395255f489"}]},{"sha":"87e4f4703a7fafc345538ee6e164a056eaf29f91","node_id":"C_kwDOALc2dtoAKDg3ZTRmNDcwM2E3ZmFmYzM0NTUzOGVlNmUxNjRhMDU2ZWFmMjlmOTE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Axel Kohlmeyer","email":"akohlmey@gmail.com","date":"2026-06-25T14:40:26Z"},"committer":{"name":"Axel Kohlmeyer","email":"akohlmey@gmail.com","date":"2026-06-25T14:40:26Z"},"message":"Move new constructor opening braces to their own line (clang-format)\n\nThe sweep that added the nullptr initializers left each constructor's opening\nbrace on the same line as the now multi-line initializer list. Normalize the\naffected constructors to the project's clang-format style: opening brace on its\nown line, initializer list reflowed at the 99-column limit.\n\nclang-format-clean files were reformatted with \"clang-format --lines\" limited to\nthe constructor range; clang-format-off files (where clang-format is a no-op)\nhad the brace moved with an equivalent text edit. No non-constructor code is\nchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HrAVWctE6TRM5n875zpBnu","tree":{"sha":"a2b4707dc721d0d21f7026be3f81b60b427708b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lammps/lammps/git/trees/a2b4707dc721d0d21f7026be3f81b60b427708b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lammps/lammps/git/commits/87e4f4703a7fafc345538ee6e164a056eaf29f91","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJHBAABCgAxFiEE7qEDdkxsYz7cisQo2bROk78MN1oFAmo9PdoTHGFrb2hsbWV5\nQGdtYWlsLmNvbQAKCRDZtE6Tvww